---
// A single-turn call: the framework sends a system + user message list, the model returns one assistant message (redraw of Fig 2-2).
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 272"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-stc-title d2-stc-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-stc-title">Request and response of a single-turn API call</title>
	<desc id="d2-stc-desc">
		The request the agent framework constructs holds a messages list with two entries: a system message written by
		the developer and a user message with the user's input. It goes to the model, Qwen3-0.6B in the example. The
		response holds one assistant message generated by the model under choices[0].message.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-stc-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Request and response of a single-turn API call</text>

	<g class="dg-container dg-harness">
		<rect x="12" y="44" width="240" height="214" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="28" y="74" font-weight="700">Request</text>
		<text x="28" y="98" class="dg-mono">messages</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="28" y="112" width="208" height="60" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="132" y="137" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent dg-mono" font-weight="700">system</text>
		<text x="132" y="159" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">written by developer</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-env">
		<rect x="28" y="182" width="208" height="60" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="132" y="207" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent dg-mono" font-weight="700">user</text>
		<text x="132" y="229" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">user input</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="300" y="127" width="120" height="100" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="360" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Model</text>
		<text x="360" y="196" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Qwen3-0.6B</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-container dg-harness">
		<rect x="468" y="44" width="240" height="214" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="484" y="74" font-weight="700">Response</text>
		<text x="484" y="98" class="dg-mono">choices[0].message</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-model">
		<rect x="484" y="147" width="208" height="60" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="588" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent dg-mono" font-weight="700">assistant</text>
		<text x="588" y="194" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">generated by model</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="252" y1="177" x2="298" y2="177" marker-end="url(#d2-stc-arrow)"></line>
		<line x1="420" y1="177" x2="466" y2="177" marker-end="url(#d2-stc-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
</svg>
